t5. the C1 perimeter: every public observation, and which admit a container
    crate JSON : ctl/json/t5_perimeter_control.json
    containers the derivation may pick: i128 i16 i32 i64 i8 u128 u16 u32 u64 u8

    public positions enumerated : 8
      fn-arg       4
      fn-ret       4

    no public position admits a container.

    known gaps in this instrument, printed rather than assumed:
      - type aliases are not followed, so a container behind an alias is a
        false negative
      - associated-type projections are not resolved, so a container reached
        through <T as Trait>::Assoc is a false negative
      - Deref targets are not followed transitively
